---
description: Prefer the vexus MCP tools for code navigation
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo has a vexus code index (semantic + call graph) exposed as MCP tools.
Before grep/file-scanning: `explore` returns a ranked map of locations and call
links for "how/where/what-calls" questions; `open` fetches exact code from it;
`trace` follows callers, callees or impact; `status` shows index health. Grep is
for exact strings, comments, config values, generated files.
